section><aside className="repertoire-tip"><span className="tip-icon">*</span><strong>Your space, your music</strong><p>Catalogue pieces are shared classics. Personal pieces stay only in this browser and are never added to the global catalogue.</p><button className="text-button" onClick={exportRepertoire}>Back up my repertoire -&gt;</button></aside></div>
